                    <!-- Git #2312 — "Send to tab" document surface for a Git Panel peek
                         (Milestone/Gate/Epic/Feature/Issue). Reuses RenderGitIdentityBlock, the
                         exact same builder the rail peek (GitPeekHost) renders through — one real
                         data path, two hosts — same "single wide column, same card builders"
