                    <!-- Settings, redesigned — Step 15 (wpf-handoff/readme-phase2.md), the real
                         Settings screen markup/computeSettings() spec in
                         wpf-handoff/Shell Skeleton v2.dc.html (lines 1441-1630, 6003-6147). One
                         surface only: the gear icon, the wrench menu and Ctrl+K palette all open
                         THIS tab (OpenSettingsTab in MainWindow.Settings.cs) — no placeholder
                         "SettingsTabView lands here" stub. Header (icon/title/health chips/search)
